usage: upgrade_workspace.py [-h] [--root ROOT] [--format {json,markdown}]
                            [--view {full,agent}] [--output OUTPUT]
                            {version,inspect,bootstrap-review,initialize,sync,authority-review,authority-apply,authority-audit,artifact-policy-review,artifact-policy-apply,collect-review,collect-apply,phase-update,cleanup-review,cleanup-apply,artifact-audit,git-audit,git-policy-review,git-policy-apply,validation-record,purge-review,purge-apply,decision-review,decision-apply,decision-audit,risk-review,risk-apply,risk-audit,recovery-audit,recovery-review,recovery-apply,exception-review,exception-apply,exception-audit,delivery-policy-review,delivery-policy-apply,delivery-policy-audit,delivery-review,delivery-apply,delivery-audit,health-check} ...

Deterministic maintenance CLI for the project-upgrade-maintainer skill.

positional arguments:
  {version,inspect,bootstrap-review,initialize,sync,authority-review,authority-apply,authority-audit,artifact-policy-review,artifact-policy-apply,collect-review,collect-apply,phase-update,cleanup-review,cleanup-apply,artifact-audit,git-audit,git-policy-review,git-policy-apply,validation-record,purge-review,purge-apply,decision-review,decision-apply,decision-audit,risk-review,risk-apply,risk-audit,recovery-audit,recovery-review,recovery-apply,exception-review,exception-apply,exception-audit,delivery-policy-review,delivery-policy-apply,delivery-policy-audit,delivery-review,delivery-apply,delivery-audit,health-check}
    version             report skill, policy, and plan schema versions without
                        mutation
    inspect             read a saved review plan with bounded progressive
                        disclosure
    bootstrap-review    read-only repository profiling and adaptive
                        initialization recommendation
    authority-review    discover project authority candidates and review
                        explicit register/rebind/unregister decisions
    authority-audit     audit registered authority sources and list
                        unregistered candidates
    artifact-policy-review
                        classify and review linkage policy for an extension
                        artifact under .upgrade

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --root ROOT           repository root
  --format {json,markdown}
  --view {full,agent}   output projection: full evidence or token-efficient
                        agent decision surface
  --output OUTPUT       write rendered output to a new repository-local path;
                        relative paths use --root
